Overview

The AI-Based Military Intelligence Dashboard is a Streamlit web application designed to analyze and visualize military conflict and attack data using Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning techniques.

The dashboard provides interactive visualizations, predictive analytics, forecasting, and AI-powered insights to support intelligence analysis.
Features
🌍 Global Threat Map
📊 Interactive Data Visualizations
🔍 Country-wise Attack Analysis
🤖 Attack Prediction using Machine Learning
📈 Forecasting using Prophet
📉 Time Series Analysis using Statsmodels
🗺️ Interactive Maps using Folium
📑 Report Generation (PDF & DOCX)
📂 Data Explorer

Technologies Used
Python
Streamlit
Pandas
NumPy
Plotly
Scikit-learn
Prophet
Statsmodels
Matplotlib
Folium
Streamlit-Folium
Joblib
ReportLab
python-docx
